  "content": "<h2>FLASHLIGHT+&nbsp;</h2><p><strong>FLASHLIGHT+</strong> 增加了先進的手持與穿戴式照明工具，改善你在夜晚的生存與探索體驗<br>非常適合在黑暗中旅行、探索洞穴或走過陰森的廢棄場所<br>設計旨在提供沉浸式照明，同時維持遊戲平衡</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_8e017f85-5d99-432b-8c5d-680fa320cc2d.png\" width=\"606\" height=\"273\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>點亮你的冒險，從此不再害怕黑暗</strong></h2><p>此模組新增</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_93a90baf-2fe9-4979-9717-3d8fe86d68c6.png\" width=\"254\" height=\"53\"></p><p>手電筒<br>一道跟隨你視線方向的可定向光束<br>手持電池時按右鍵即可充電</p><p>頭燈<br>挖礦和夜間冒險時的免手持照明工具<br>將頭燈與電池一同放入鐵砧即可充電</p><p>提燈<br>可手持或放置的持續溫暖光源<br>一旦電力耗盡便無法再充電</p><p>夜視護目鏡&nbsp;<br>無需放置任何光源即可在完全黑暗中看清事物<br><br></p><p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>依賴模組</strong><br>需要&nbsp;<strong>TCTCore</strong>（V5.2+）<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載連結</a></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xhJ_YRub4lI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_aaae6a95-296e-4267-9808-c06737fcfa56.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"151\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_76e218ff-5671-4b3b-8dc8-80cccc84e5bd.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"147\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_6c62c656-9836-49e6-8090-1470908408ca.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"152\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_71d435fb-3b53-4111-be28-f4b76c9b4a3e.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"179\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_58a55a00-bf87-4c02-b906-37c899d7d8fc.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
